  "releaseNotes": [
    "Pose-safe geometric ambient visibility at 42 mm and 145 mm, with the turret race and roof seat kept in contact.",
    "Fixed seams keep local bolts, suspension and the repeating track bank as blockers. Hinged and rotating receivers are baked separately.",
    "Small fixed seat witnesses can shade their own covers. Moving closures do not cast their closed shape onto the fixed hull.",
    "Only the red channel of the 4K Body, 2K Track and 1K Guard atlases is updated. All other payloads are byte-exact."
